CDialogTree
{
Name=The Crypt Captains
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=0
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the bonecaller
Text=<The thing in the rotted mail does not raise its weapon.> You are not one of theirs and you are not one of mine, so you are the first new thing on this plateau in longer than I can count. Speak, if you have something that is not a sword.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Wielder IS
Reply Text=Something rides behind my eyes. It says you are not free either.
Go to node ID=10 bound

Requirement=General Divine Skills moreequal 80
Reply Text=I have read the bindings on lesser things than you. Yours is still knotted.
Go to node ID=10 bound

Requirement=Speech moreequal 80
Reply Text=Two hundred years of the same order. Who gave it, and are they still alive to lift it?
Go to node ID=10 bound

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You said something that is not a sword. Name it.
Go to node ID=15 the offer

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What are you?
Go to node ID=5 the answer

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have nothing to say to the dead.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt Bonecaller fights
}
Action=CGoToCombatAction
{
Enemy Name=$Trigger
}
}
}
Icon=Fight Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 the answer
Text=A bonecaller. The last one, I think, unless others were buried better than I was. I raise what falls and I send it up the hill, and the knights in the keep cut it down, and tomorrow I raise it again. You may call that a siege. I have stopped calling it anything.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then why keep doing it?
Go to node ID=1 the bonecaller

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Because you were told to.
Go to node ID=10 bound

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Enough talk.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt Bonecaller fights
}
Action=CGoToCombatAction
{
Enemy Name=$Trigger
}
}
}
Icon=Fight Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 bound
Text=You see it, then. I did not choose this hill. Something raised me and pointed me at a spear on the far side of those walls, and the pointing has outlived the hand. I cannot put the order down. It is not in me to put it down. That is the whole of my condition.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Speech moreequal 110
Reply Text=Then hear a new order, from the only mouth still here to give one: stop.
Go to node ID=20 stands down

Requirement=General Divine Skills moreequal 80
Reply Text=It is a knot, not a chain. Hold still and I will take it off you.
Go to node ID=20 stands down

Requirement=Karma LESS 600
Reply Text=Keep your orders. I will open the keep for you, and you will owe me the spear.
Go to node ID=21 the bargain

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then you die with it on.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt Bonecaller fights
}
Action=CGoToCombatAction
{
Enemy Name=$Trigger
}
}
}
Icon=Fight Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 stands down
Text=Oh. <It looks at its own hands for a while.> Then I am done with the hill, and the hill is not done with me -- they will come for me the moment they notice. Good. Let them come. I have raised every one of them twice and I know exactly where the joints are.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Fight well.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=6
Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt truce ends
}
