------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 the bonewright
Text=The Bonewright stops on the shale, and behind you the fallen begin to sit up. It is not raising them from anywhere. It is raising them from here, from what is already on this ground, and it will go on doing it while it stands.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=101 the bonewright falls
Text=The Bonewright falls, and the dead it raised fall with it. For the first time since you came up here, nothing new is getting to its feet.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=110 the sergeant
Text=This one has kept its rank. It moves its section with its off hand -- two fingers and they wheel -- and it has not once looked at you, because you are not yet the problem.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=111 the sergeant rallies
Text=It whistles through the hole where its jaw was. As the dull whistle echoes, every undead in earshot turns towards you. You are the problem now.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=112 the sergeant fixates
Text=It drops the hand signals. Whatever held the rank together has finally gone out of it, and it comes for you alone, straight through its own dead.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 the bargain
Text=Owe you. <It tries the word out like a coin it has not been offered in a long time.> Then we are two things with an order each, and yours is newer. Break the door and I will walk in behind you, and what the knights have been dying all this time to keep will be handed to me by something still breathing. That is better than the siege. That is very nearly a joke.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then follow me.
Go to node ID=
