------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=130 the dead not us
Text=Not us. Him. He is waiting.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=131 the dead that way
Text=Go on. The one who raises us is that way.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=132 the dead told not to
Text=We were told not to touch you. Do not make us.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=135 the dead his now
Text=You are his now. Walk.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=136 the dead the door
Text=The door. You promised him the door.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=137 the dead with you
Text=Go on. We are with you.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=120 the bonecaller calls
Text=Here, breathing one. I will not raise a hand to you, which is more than the hill will promise. Come and hear an offer.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 the offer
Text=Then here it is. The knights hold a door, and behind it is the spear I was pointed at before you were born. Break the door for me, and the dead will walk around you for as long as you are on this hill. Refuse, and you are one more thing that breathes on a plateau of things that do not.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Karma LESS 600
Reply Text=Keep your orders, then. I will open the keep for you, and you will owe me the spear.
Go to node ID=21 the bargain

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=There may be another way. Let me look at what binds you.
Go to node ID=10 bound

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=No.
Go to node ID=16 then go
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt truce ends
}
Is Default Reply=1

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=16 then go
Text=Then go, and take the hill as you find it. I will not hold them back a second time.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=200 the herald
Text=<A skeleton in the rags of a herald's tabard holds up an empty hand.> The one who raises us would speak with you. He waits close by, behind his dead. Will you come and hear him? If you will, the dead will not lay a hand on you until you have.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will hear him.
Go to node ID=201 the herald steps aside
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt truce begins
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=No. Get out of my way.
Go to node ID=202 the herald turns
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt herald refused
}
Is Default Reply=1

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=201 the herald steps aside
Text=<It lowers the hand and steps out of your way.> Then walk. They will not touch you. Do not touch them.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=202 the herald turns
Text=<The hand closes.> Then you will meet him the other way.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=210 the debt
Text=<The herald has come down after you, and the doorway behind it is full of the dead.> He kept his word. Not one of them lifted a hand to you on that hill. Now the spear.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Speech moreequal 110
Reply Text=<Lie> He will have it, when I have finished what it is for. Tell him that.
Go to node ID=211 he can wait

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=The spear is mine. He was a fool to bargain with me.
Go to node ID=212 a thing that breaks its word
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt the debt is refused
}
Is Default Reply=1

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=211 he can wait
Text=<It looks at the spear for a long time.> He has waited two hundred years. He can wait for you. But he will always know where you are.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=212 a thing that breaks its word
Text=<The hand closes.> Then you are a thing that breaks its word, on a hill that has only ever held two kinds. Take it, then, if you can carry it out.
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
